            <profile name="Virtue" id="d675-18aa-ea2b-06fd" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While this model is in play, when a Friendly Buto, Jumo or Monk model spends a Virtue Token you may choose one of the following effects:
- Reduce the cost of this model’s Special Attacks or Defences by (1)
- Sweep Attack (1) and Sweep Defence (1)
- Throw Attack (1) and Throw Defence (1)
- Immovable</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Oyabun" id="d85d-edf5-0790-34f1" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model may only target Buto, Jumo and Monks with its Inspiration Ki Feat.
This model cannot be recruited into the same Warband as Oda or Tautolu.
This model cannot declare Run or Charge Actions. When this model is Killed, replace this model and profile card with those of Oda.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
