          <profiles>
            <profile name="Kabuki" id="daa9-5d81-14f9-1f92" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model cannot target Ken. This model can draw LoS through Ken and ignores Ken and Ken’s ZoC for all game purposes. This model cannot move through Ken.

Jo: Begin the game with Jo. Each model using Fortune may re-flip the coin. In the Starting Phase of any turn you may lose Jo and gain Ha for the rest of the game.
Ha: This model loses Insignificant and Slow.
Kyu: In the final turn of the game, while this model is in play, every time a model with RC&gt;10 is removed from play, another model in the same Warband loses an Activation Counter.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
