              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">Urchin models in Fai-ginn’s Warband gain Camouflage (4&quot;), Dodge (+1) and when declaring a Scenario Action Urchins may make a Walk before or after resolving the action while Fai-ginn is in play.

During the End Phase you can transfer an Enhancement card on this model to a Friendly model within 8&quot;.</characteristic>
