                <characteristic name="Specials" typeId="cdaf-b6ac-89d4-39ef"/>
                <characteristic name="Unique Effects" typeId="3bf8-6525-f003-4990">Something is Always Near:
This model&apos;s Dancing Shadows weapon ignores Cover and Camouflage when performing a Ranged Attack Action and Ranged Attacks.
If the Enemy model would have had Cover, change this weapon&apos;s Ranged Weapon Strength to +2 instead of -2 and it gains Pierce (2).</characteristic>
