              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model&apos;s Fear value is variable.
X is equal to the number of Friendly Shadows currently on the battlefield.
If there is a Darkness or Breath of Yurei effect in play, this model gains Dread (2) and Shatei gain Fearless and Sixth Sense.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
