      <profiles>
        <profile name="Lantern" id="babd-f5f3-a457-5700" hidden="false" typeId="6fa2-988d-fc04-c751" typeName="Special Card (Terrain)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">30mm</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Normal</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Clear</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Small</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">When a Friendly model Targets or Chooses an Enemy model within 2&quot; of a Lantern, it may ignore Camouflage, Darkness, Cover and Breath of Yurei until the end of the Activation.
When a Lantern is destroyed models within 2&quot; of the Lantern gain a On Fire (2) Marker.
If there are no Illuminator models in play, remove all Lanterns from the Battlefield in the End Phase.
Before Fudo, the Illuminator&apos;s activation, one other Friendly Lantern may move 3&quot;.
At the End of Fudo, the Illuminator&apos;s activation, you may destroy one Lantern terrain element in play.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
