      <profiles>
        <profile name="Shadow" id="2fd5-62e8-9387-3ab2" hidden="false" typeId="6fa2-988d-fc04-c751" typeName="Special Card (Terrain)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">30mm</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Normal</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Clear</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Zero</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">When this Terrain is put into play, choose one of the following types of shadow:

- Animal Shadow:
Enemy models moving within 2&quot; of this terrain must make a Size Challenge Test (5) and take a Damage Roll of the Success Level. Apply Armour and Tough as usual.

- Castle Shadow:
Enemy models treat this terrain as Diffcult terrain, Friendly models treat this terran as Ideal terrain. Friendly models may gain Cover from this terrain.

- Hero&apos;s Shadow:
This terrain has Leadership [Kabuki]:(1/6&quot;). This terrain has Bodyguard [Shadow Master]:(3&quot;) when using this trait all conditions are considered met if the friendly model is within range and both are not in contact with an Enemy model when using this trait. Enemy models contacting this terrain take a SL 1 Damage Roll (apply Armour and Tough as usual), cannot continue movement after contacting this terrain and this terrain is removed from play, Shooting this terrain has no effect on it.

- Dragon&apos;s Shadow:
Models within 6&quot; of this Shadow may re-flip Fortune Flips.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Luck Tokens" id="4a2a-5fd6-b6b4-3142" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
