                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model may only be included in the Iron Fist Gumi Theme.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Virtue" id="d642-c6e3-49ac-7b93" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While this model is in play, when a Friendly Shatei model spends a Virtue Token you may chocse one of the following effects:
- This model gains Fearless until the current activation ends.
- This model gains Stun Attack (0) until the current activation ends.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Pocket Sand" id="647f-977f-b127-6708" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">During this model&apos;s activation, either before or after resolving any action, this model may make a ranged attack with Pocket Sand.
This does not cause this model to lose an Activation Counter.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
