              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">At the end of any of this model&apos;s activations, one Enemy model that is not an Animal or Insignificant within 2&quot; gains a Scheme Token if it has none.


When playing nominated VIM, instead, you may select a Friendly model with Disguise to be your chosen VIM.
