          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Play in the Starting Phase before Ki Generation, Friendly models with Fortune must use it this turn.
If the Fortune call is successful, in addition to usual effects, the model gains an Activation Counter.
If the Fortune call is unsuccessful, in addition to usual effects, remove an Activation Counter from the model.

Requirement [Warband with no Kabuki or Shadow Master models]</characteristic>
