          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When attached model makes a test, it must re-roll any 6s.
If the re-rolled dice is also a 6, after all re-rolls, then the attached model&apos;s owner chooses one of their opponent&apos;s models other than Fuku, to transfer this attachment to.
